WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:01,990
I take back what I said before

2
00:00:01,990 --> 00:00:04,070
You do have the capital to be self-defeating

3
00:00:04,070 --> 00:00:07,300
But you are still too careless

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:16,740
Not Zhai Xing Pavilion

5
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:18,140
where is this

6
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:24,010
Chuan Song Town

7
00:00:24,010 --> 00:00:25,610
Brutal and brainless

8
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:27,290
Go and talk to the people in the mountains

9
00:00:27,290 --> 00:00:36,370
Where did he tell Laoshan?

10
00:00:36,370 --> 00:00:41,720
People from the four major families

11
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:45,020
It would be nice if it was really that easy to die, right?

12
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:46,610
Take this

13
00:00:46,610 --> 00:00:54,120
The clouds and smoke are inside

14
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:56,550
Find an opportunity to let him go later
